join Syn_Lucretia center
Syn_Lucretia: I’ve made it to the statue, but it’s guarded by even more monster-zombie-things. Convenient timing, looks like we’re both in for a fight.
join Lucretia left
Lucretia: Yeah. Rohan is definitely here somewhere…
join Rohan_Moore center
Rohan_Moore: Talking to yourself, are you? I’m impressed you’ve managed to follow me this far… to where it all started. Tell me, what is your name?
Lucretia: Lucretia. I need to speak to Argus. The deals we’ve made – they’re not right. We’re destroying our world!
Rohan_Moore: It’s true. With each zombie mutated and demon brought to our realm, Argus’ power grows. A new empire is coming, one with him and I on top. Why else would I have released the virus?
Lucretia:  You can’t trust him, Rohan! Together, we can still fix this. We can undo the deals we made.
Rohan_Moore: It’s too late. He’s here, and I will ascend to join him in ruling this new world, one without useless fighting and inefficiencies. Ultimate peace and order…
join Argus rightmost
Argus: Well done, Mr. Moore. You’ve accomplished your end of the bargain. And now it’s time for mine. Ascension… or, mutation.
Rohan_Moore:  What? NOOOOOOO!
Lucretia: Argus!!